data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","toolCallId":"call_00_SoUKc7atZWVDLwP0CalQ7036","messageId":"667f0b1f-0da9-475a-ba3c-1ac747c04320","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"status\":\"available\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"creatorVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"versions\":{\"@za38.03/agent-ui-core\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-renderer\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-runtime\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-web-component\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-creator\":\"0.0.1\"},\"sourceDigest\":\"94a13413ebe7fd333795d6853a92ea9f6d658adb20a98abaf014d7aac5288d5c\",\"documentId\":\"public:plugins/conversation-surface\",\"title\":\"定制选项\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"插件\",\"path\":\"plugins/conversation-surface.md\",\"summary\":\"用户可以在同一区域阅读已有对话、查看新回复并继续提问；工具结果、计划等内容会显示在对应的消息中。 日常调整可以交给 Creator；需要自己写代码时，直接查看手动开发。\",\"sha256\":\"cb9a7212f21a1f1e94e3f22365bd88ac21a7638cc4d0b6b9c50c48c97925fc4c\",\"sectionId\":\"s15\",\"offset\":0,\"totalCharacters\":190,\"content\":\"## 定制选项\\n\\n| 可以改什么     | 效果                  |\\n| --------- | ------------------- |\\n| 对话区大小     | 调整高度、宽度和最小高度。       |\\n| 对话区外观     | 调整背景、边框、圆角和间距。      |\\n| 空白对话的备用内容 | 没有配置欢迎区时，显示一段自定义内容。 |\\n\\n\",\"nextOffset\":null}}","role":"tool"}

data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_START","toolCallId":"call_01_8YdVwlqyCDfWEfDxeLs40867","toolCallName":"read_creator_documentation"}

data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_ARGS","toolCallId":"call_01_8YdVwlqyCDfWEfDxeLs40867","delta":"{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:plugins/conversation-surface\",\"sectionId\":\"s35\",\"offset\":0,\"limit\":4000}"}

