data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","toolCallId":"call_00_36eL4O2t01eAMMncoJrp2438","messageId":"dd915daa-5bed-4287-bd81-7c701d14890f","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"status\":\"available\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"creatorVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"versions\":{\"@za38.03/agent-ui-core\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-renderer\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-runtime\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-web-component\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-creator\":\"0.0.1\"},\"sourceDigest\":\"94a13413ebe7fd333795d6853a92ea9f6d658adb20a98abaf014d7aac5288d5c\",\"documentId\":\"public:guide/examples/brand-copy\",\"title\":\"页面发生了什么变化\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"Creator\",\"path\":\"guide/examples/brand-copy.md\",\"summary\":\"实际修改名称、欢迎语和推荐问题，核对页面与点击结果。\",\"sha256\":\"53651d06ce6a5d351b10466499aefd6ab0796b765b179750a11aa1bdd24835b7\",\"sectionId\":\"s17\",\"offset\":0,\"totalCharacters\":509,\"content\":\"## 页面发生了什么变化\\n\\n修改前：\\n\\n![本轮测试开始时的默认名称和欢迎内容。](/images/guide/examples/20261027/assistant-before.png)\\n\\n修改后，名称和欢迎语符合请求。下图使用本轮保存的修改后版本重新打开，未手工调整任务代码。\\n\\n![名称修改后的页面，显示小招、新欢迎语和三张业务推荐卡片。](/images/guide/examples/20261027/brand-after.png)\\n\\n推荐卡片的**可见标题被 Creator 写成了简短名称**，并未逐字显示请求中的问句。问句用于点击后发送：\\n\\n| 页面标题    | 点击后发送的问题   |\\n| ------- | ---------- |\\n| 账户余额查询  | 如何查询账户余额？  |\\n| 转账到账时间  | 转账多久到账？    |\\n| 信用卡账单查询 | 如何查询信用卡账单？ |\\n\\n本轮实际切换英文检查了名称、欢迎语和推荐内容；在后续局部调整后，也逐一点击三张卡片，确认发送的仍是上表中的问题。\\n\\n如果要求卡片上也完整显示问句，需要继续指出这一点。本轮没有把它当作已经逐字完成的结果。\\n\",\"nextOffset\":null}}","role":"tool"}

data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_START","toolCallId":"call_01_oPpfDObR4KyNO0frfonK2986","toolCallName":"read_creator_documentation"}

data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_ARGS","toolCallId":"call_01_oPpfDObR4KyNO0frfonK2986","delta":"{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/styling-and-localization\",\"limit\":4000,\"offset\":0,\"sectionId\":\"s33\"}"}

data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_END","toolCallId":"call_01_oPpfDObR4KyNO0frfonK2986"}

data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","toolCallId":"call_01_oPpfDObR4KyNO0frfonK2986","messageId":"fa6f7c84-b1a6-4b2f-92b2-851ce3c45d7d","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"status\":\"available\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"creatorVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"versions\":{\"@za38.03/agent-ui-core\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-renderer\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-runtime\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-web-component\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-creator\":\"0.0.1\"},\"sourceDigest\":\"94a13413ebe7fd333795d6853a92ea9f6d658adb20a98abaf014d7aac5288d5c\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/styling-and-localization\",\"title\":\"修改已有文案\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/styling-and-localization.md\",\"summary\":\"样式和文案在项目中定制，沿用工程已有的 UI 库、样式方案和版本。需要 Creator 帮你修改时，见主题与样式需求和语言与文案需求。\",\"sha256\":\"07565c50b9b15f2c07e5c7e173c79b7bdf6232fd28ab3aef8295afba07e9a68a\",\"sectionId\":\"s33\",\"offset\":0,\"totalCharacters\":672,\"content\":\"## 修改已有文案\\n\\n通过 `Agent` 的 `locales` 属性覆盖需要修改的文案：\\n\\n```tsx\\n<Agent locales={{\\n  'zh-CN': { composer: { placeholder: '输入你的问题' } },\\n  'en-US': { composer: { placeholder: 'Ask your question' } },\\n}} />\\n```\\n\\n默认翻译由 npm 提供，两种语言的覆盖保持一致。\\n\\n组件通过工程已有的统一 Hook 读取：\\n\\n```tsx\\nimport { useAgentUILocale } from '@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins';\\n\\nexport function ComposerHint() {\\n  const labels = useAgentUILocale('composer');\\n  return <p>{labels.placeholder}</p>;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n不直接按语言写条件分支，也不复制一套独立 i18n 状态。\\n\\n官方文案沿用现有域；`Agent.locales` 不注册任意新命名空间或键。新增业务文案集中在项目共享消息模块，按领域组织完整双语表，通过统一的 `useAgentUILocaleCode()` 值选择文案。组件不写语言条件，不创建每插件国际化 Hook 或独立语言状态，纯展示函数接收文案参数。示例见[插件 API](/development/plugin-api.md#主题与多语言)。\\n\\n\",\"nextOffset\":null}}","role":"tool"}

