data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","toolCallId":"call_01_RsrZDzaRdqI662Ht2mdF3885","messageId":"0da7d49f-6e79-4f22-ace7-bbadaa14c5c4","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"status\":\"available\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"creatorVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"versions\":{\"@za38.03/agent-ui-core\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-renderer\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-runtime\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-web-component\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-creator\":\"0.0.1\"},\"sourceDigest\":\"94a13413ebe7fd333795d6853a92ea9f6d658adb20a98abaf014d7aac5288d5c\",\"documentId\":\"public:guide/adjustments/localization\",\"title\":\"Creator 实际怎样处理\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"Creator\",\"path\":\"guide/adjustments/localization.md\",\"summary\":\"把要替换的文字和中英文内容直接告诉 Creator。本页记录 2026 年 10 月 27 日的实际测试，没有向它提供代码位置或参数名称。\",\"sha256\":\"a9588bbae15d846e78097be91efe1a9c61e268810243a1cddeb972e0292d26ac\",\"sectionId\":\"s11\",\"offset\":0,\"totalCharacters\":162,\"content\":\"## Creator 实际怎样处理\\n\\nCreator 自行找到输入框文案和可访问标签的接入位置，修改了四份项目文件，代码检查通过。它说明本次没有实际测试屏幕阅读器播报。\\n\\n![Creator 的实际修改总结和检查回执。](/images/guide/examples/20261027/locale-reply.png)\\n\\n\",\"nextOffset\":null}}","role":"tool"}

